# PHPUnit Execution

- Before running a targeted PHPUnit command, resolve the test file with Glob and copy its exact repository-relative path into `TEST_FILE`; do not reconstruct test paths from memory.
- Run Docker-backed `php-test` invocations sequentially. Concurrent runs share ECR login, credential-helper, and tester database state.
